## Project defaults

- Clean Architecture; presentation never depends on data implementations
- MVI (`State` / `Action` / `Event` + Root/Screen split)
- Koin only; domain interfaces for every ViewModel dependency
- Nav3 hub home + push destinations
- Fakes over mocks; JUnit5 + AssertK + Turbine
- Compose + Material3; animation skill for non-trivial motion